sequenceDiagram
accTitle: CloudFront substitutes the body only after an origin error
accDescr: A normal response passes through, while an origin 502 causes CloudFront to obtain an independent S3 error page and preserve the 502 status.
participant U as Viewer
participant C as CloudFront
participant A as ALB origin
participant S as Private S3
U->>C: Request application
C->>A: Forward request
alt Origin succeeds
A-->>C: 200 and application body
C-->>U: 200 and application body
else Origin returns 502
A-->>C: 502
C->>S: Error-page path, signed by OAC
S-->>C: Branded HTML
C-->>U: 502 and branded HTML
end
